          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "VIDEO MIXER\nThe Video Mixer is used to mix multiple textures to single texture.\nEach layer in the Video Mixer has its own opacity slider.\nThe Video Mixer as a whole has a blend mode, the blend mode decides how the layers interact with each other.\nThe entire Video Mixer can be bypassed as a whole (bypass is hidden by default)."
          }
